  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Plane passes through the points</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>We know that the equation of a plane passing through three non-collinear points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Now image of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></math> in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>",
